  "identifier": "mirp",
  "name": "MIRP",
  "alternateName": [
    "Medical Image Radiomics Processor"
  ],
  "description": "Python package for standardised medical image radiomics and preprocessing. Handles DICOM, NIfTI, and NRRD input, performs image preprocessing (resampling, normalisation, discretisation), processes regions of interest, and extracts quantitative radiomic features compliant with the Image Biomarker Standardisation Initiative (IBSI). Also supports preprocessing pipelines for deep learning workflows. EUPL-1.2, 84 stars, v2.6.0 (May 2026, actively maintained). Published in Journal of Open Source Software 2024. Developed by Alex Zwanenburg et al. at OncoRay, National Center for Radiation Research in Oncology, TU Dresden.",
